---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Klozdesk handles information sent through this website. This notice covers the website, not the pilot product."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <Eyebrow>Privacy</Eyebrow>
      <h1>Privacy, <em>in plain language.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This notice covers the Klozdesk website. It does not cover the pilot product. Pilot
        customers receive a separate data processing agreement before any customer data enters
        the system.
      </p>
      <p class="small mt-1">Last updated: 18 November 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Klozdesk is a product of Sparkr Digitals, based in Nigeria. For privacy questions about
          this website, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What this notice covers</h2>
        <p>
          This notice covers <strong>klozdesk.com</strong> and the information you choose to send
          us through it. It does not cover the Klozdesk pilot product, customer deal data, or any
          service governed by a separate agreement.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Information you email us.</strong> Your name, email address, company, and
            whatever you choose to include in your message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Technical logs.</strong> Our hosting provider may record basic request data
            such as IP address, browser type, and request time to keep the site secure and
            reliable.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>No advertising trackers.</strong> We do not run third-party advertising
            pixels or sell contact data.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To reply to your inquiry and discuss a possible pilot.</li>
          <li>To operate, secure, and troubleshoot the website.</li>
          <li>To meet legal, accounting, or regulatory obligations that apply to us.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We share information only with service providers that help us operate the website or
          respond to you—for example, our hosting provider—and with professional advisers where
          necessary. We do not sell personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We keep inquiry emails for up to 12 months unless a business relationship requires a
          longer period. Technical logs are kept according to our hosting provider’s retention
          settings. When information is no longer needed, we delete it or anonymize it.
        </p>

        <h2>International transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Our website hosting provider may process technical logs outside Nigeria. Before pilot
          customer data enters the product, we will confirm the provider terms, transfer
          safeguards, and subprocessor list in the pilot agreement.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on applicable law, you may ask to access, correct, or delete personal
          information we hold about you, or object to certain processing. Email
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will respond within a
          reasonable period.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not set advertising cookies. Our hosting provider may use strictly
          necessary technical storage to serve the site securely. If we add analytics later, we
          will update this notice before enabling it.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this notice as the website or the company changes. The date at the top of
          this page shows the latest version.
        </p>

        <div class="callout">
          <strong>This is a website notice, not the pilot DPA.</strong> If you are joining the
          pilot, the data processing agreement—not this page—governs customer deal data, consent,
          retention, deletion, and subprocessors.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
